# RDNF match simplification: match arms are collected and their result types unioned.
# Before: infer_match returned Unknown for all match expressions.
# After: returns normalize_union(arm_types) |> simplify_type — precise and deduplicated.
# Both arms of [match result [Ok v] v [Error _] 0] are type-checked without error.
# The eval output verifies runtime correctness: Ok arm executes and returns payload.
[result: [try [fn [] 42]]
 value: [match result
   [Ok v]:  v
   [Error _]: 0]]
=== out
Dict({"result": Variant(Ok, Int(42)), "value": Int(42)})
